{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Back Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the year 2035, industries have collapsed, human population is only a fraction of what it used to be. It's unknown what exactly the explosion that left the Earth in its current state was, some speculate it was a nuke while others believe in more mystical explanations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a freelance delivery man in this world where communication infrastructure is non-existent. Drive through difficult terrain, abandoned routes and overcome many challenges to finish the job. Unlock new vehicles and choose the right one for every job.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Driving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Last Delivery Man On Earth features semi-realistic, grounded, weighty and challenging driving. Each vehicle behaves in a unique way based on its specifications, such as if it's rear-wheel drive, front-wheel drive or all-wheel drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/compressed_driving-showcase-1.gif?t=1747195106\" /></div>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish jobs and optional tasks to unlock new jobs and vehicles. Each job offers unique challenges to overcome. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736240?t=1747195106","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/bb187418263885cba92eab299964339b97448ca0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747195106","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/12977ac1e262bb2c0cce2ed905c79fd3ab4f8807/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747195106","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/12977ac1e262bb2c0cce2ed905c79fd3ab4f8807/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747195106","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Back Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the year 2035, industries have collapsed, human population is only a fraction of what it used to be. It's unknown what exactly the explosion that left the Earth in its current state was, some speculate it was a nuke while others believe in more mystical explanations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a freelance delivery man in this world where communication infrastructure is non-existent. Drive through difficult terrain, abandoned routes and overcome many challenges to finish the job. Unlock new vehicles and choose the right one for every job.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Driving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Last Delivery Man On Earth features semi-realistic, grounded, weighty and challenging driving. Each vehicle behaves in a unique way based on its specifications, such as if it's rear-wheel drive, front-wheel drive or all-wheel drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/compressed_driving-showcase-1.gif?t=1747195106\" /></div>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish jobs and optional tasks to unlock new jobs and vehicles. Each job offers unique challenges to overcome. </p>","developers":["Rebind"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/68f4411ded7fd3eb187082f3701f7d59bb686824/hea